922 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2025 0 R
/ActualText (Automation: IaC automates the provisioning and management of cloud resources, eliminating manual errors and saving time.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
923 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2026 0 R
/ActualText (Consistency: IaC ensures that your infrastructure is deployed consistently across different environments, reducing the risk of configuration drift.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
924 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2027 0 R
/ActualText (Version Control: IaC code can be stored in version control systems like Git, allowing you to track changes, collaborate with others, and roll back to previous configurations if needed.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
925 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2028 0 R
/ActualText (Scalability: IaC makes it easy to scale your infrastructure up or down based on demand, ensuring optimal performance and cost efficiency.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
