1311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2178 0 R
/ActualText (Agility: The cloud's flexibility and scalability enable rapid provisioning of resources and faster deployment cycles, essential for DevOps.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1312 0 obj
<<
